# The HTTP form of a proto contract: the HTTP variation point attached to a
# service that already has the gRPC one, serving the same contract over HTTP.
# Besides the HTTP form, the example adds AddItem and ListItems with an
# in-memory store so it shows a path parameter, 201, 404, 409, and a deprecated
# method; those commands are why the gRPC endpoint, the command registry, and
# the command tests change.
base library/architecture/go/vp-grpc-api-in-go.skill/examples
examples examples-proto
change cmd/todo/main.go
change go.mod
change go.sum
change Makefile
change README.md
change buf.yaml
change buf.gen.yaml
change docs/integration/api/todo/todo.proto
change gen/api/todo/*
change internal/api/grpc/endpoint/items.go
change internal/api/grpc/endpoint/features/items.feature
change internal/api/grpc/endpoint/test/*
change internal/command/handlers.go
change internal/command/test/runner_test.go
